  "blast": "2.17.0; Ubuntu ships 2.12.0, five years older, so bioconda is used for this pin too.",
  "diamond": "2.2.8 clears the >= 2.2.7 floor the determinism controls require. Ubuntu's archive ships 2.1.9, which does NOT, so apt cannot satisfy this pin and bioconda is used instead.",
  "hmmer": "3.4 is the current release (Aug 2023); needed by L1-2, L2-1, L3-4",
  "mafft": "7.526; the controls require only a pinned major version plus deterministic modes.",
  "mmseqs2": "18.8cc5c is the current release. MMseqs2 is the tool most likely to fail thread invariance (upstream issue #277: results differ by core count), so the suite decides whether this pin is usable rather than the version number.",
  "prodigal": "2.6.3 is the final Prodigal release. Prodigal-GV is a DIFFERENT tool and is not in the image."
 },
